        {
          "end_ms": null,
          "error": null,
          "field": "description",
          "page_id": "page-b7d4cf4f97802cf88bf59116",
          "qa_findings": [],
          "review_status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "segment_id": "seg-742a73fdd939a4c6401d182b",
          "segment_index": 13,
          "source_segment_id": "seg-742a73fdd939a4c6401d182b",
          "source_text_sha256": "5eb9968b88b5704b2c6210672de05f476c953bb8033cec85238ca62ac2440c48",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On November 12, 2017, at 5:15 p.m. (local time), a witness at their residence observed a very bright, opaque, white, oval-shaped object at the zenith. The witness observed the PAN with binoculars in a clear sky: they initially thought it was a weather balloon but were surprised as the object was nearly motionless. No unusual noises were heard. The witness and a patrol from the gendarmerie unit observed the phenomenon until 6:15 p.m., when it moved towards the East. The witness took a photograph (original not transmitted to GEIPAN). Only one testimony was collected. For both the witness and the gendarmes, this observation resembled the passage of a \"weather balloon\". This hypothesis was verified with the Air Transport Brigade in Lamentin (972). After consulting the \"Flight Radar\" site, it was determined to be a balloon deployed in Puerto Rico that was pushed towards Martinique by high-altitude winds. These balloons are part of the Loon project, which aims to provide internet access to disaster-stricken and/or difficult-to-reach areas using high-altitude balloons. Following the passage of Hurricane Maria in September 2017 over Puerto Rico, it was decided to use a fleet of balloons to allow Puerto Ricans without cellular connectivity, due to the destruction of antennas, to use their phones' basic functions. The GEIPAN classified this case as 'A', observing a stratospheric balloon from Puerto Rico pushed towards Martinique by high-altitude winds.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "8c06fa4514aa2bc7af9e6854d96fc25c49ce5777b1bd36654630c2574791788a"
        }
      ],
